    "description": "Title:\nDecatur Industries Pipe Rack With Humidor Wood Assorted Tobacco Pipes Tools USA\nBrand:\nDecatur Industries\nDepartment:\nAdults\nCondition:\nPre-owned - Fair\nCondition Description:\nFair - displays visible wear and surface cracks\nSize Type:\nRegular\nSize:\n12 x 8 x 8 in\nStyle:\nMid-Century Classic\nColor:\nBrown\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nBrand Mark:\nDecatur Industries Inc. (sticker on felt base)\nBundle Description:\nIncludes wooden pipe rack\nBundle Listing:\nYes\nCountry Of Origin:\nUSA\nFeatures:\nIntegrated humidor barrel\nFinish:\nNatural Wood\nMaterial:\nWood (rack and humidor)\nModel:\nWooden Pipe Rack with Barrel Humidor\nMounting:\nDesktop/Freestanding\nNumber Of Pieces:\n10\nOriginal/Reproduction:\nVintage Original\nPattern:\nWoodgrain\nProduct Type:\nWooden Pipe Rack with Humidor and Assorted Pipes\nRoom:\nOffice, Study, Den, Living Room\nSet Includes:\nPipe rack, humidor barrel with lid, 5 assorted pipes\nShape:\nRectangular Base with Barrel Humidor\nTheme:\nVintage Smoking Accessories\nDescription:\nAdd timeless charm and practical organization to your collection or study with this vintage wooden pipe rack and humidor set by Decatur Industries. The set includes a beautifully crafted woodgrain rack with space for up to six pipes, alongside a classic barrel-shaped humidor designed to keep your tobacco fresh. The rich brown wooden construction provides both durability and a handsome display, complemented by a soft felted base with an original Decatur Industries sticker for added vintage appeal. This set also comes with five assorted pipes, featuring a variety of materials such as wood and a distinctive corn cob model, each displaying unique character marks of use. The humidor barrel contains four metal smoking tools, perfect for pipe maintenance. Visible signs of age include scratches and a noticeable split on the humidor's side, as well as typical wear on the pipes, which speaks to its authentic vintage status. Ideal for a thoughtful gift or a distinguished display, this piece offers a blend of function, history, and visual interest for any tobacco enthusiast or collector\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
